  "details": "This module enables you to use AI on the website. It includes an AI Chatbot submodule allows you to setup a chatbot.\n\nUnder certain configurations, the chatbot does not sufficiently filter user input before rendering it, potentially allowing cross-site scripting (XSS).\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact that an attacker must have access to administer blocks.",
